  "revisions": [
    {
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "rev": "r1",
      "why": "wave 1b: frostglass lancer at the board three-quarter view, chunky and rounded (pointed cone helm, round pauldrons, planted spear in the right hand, left fist at the hip, ragged cape panels), framed at drawn size K=4"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "rev": "r1b",
      "why": "bigger hooded cone helm (not a party hat); spear leaned forward and lowered to fit the canvas; ortho 2.4"
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "rev": "r2-template",
      "why": "mq-02 shared primitives wired; no new design values selected. TODO_DESIGN fields block the gate until the design owner supplies r2 parameters."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "rev": "r2",
      "why": "owner: lancer too boxy. Director r2 sculpt from source measurements: slender V-taper torso loft (chest 0.42 > waist 0.30), pointed hood loft leaning back, modest pauldron caps (polar cut 1.75), limbs at about half r1 radius with anatomical profiles, knee guards, legs about 53% of height, ragged two-part cloak (wrap 3.4, hem 1.15, flare 0.18, 12 notches), spear upright in the far hand with the tip above the hood."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "rev": "r2b",
      "why": "director review of the r2 Blender render: domed pauldrons covering the shoulder, armoured limb mass (~30% thicker), broader chest, cowl hood with a wider base, continuous cloak with a ragged hem only at the bottom, fur mantle around the collar (as the source)."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "rev": "r2c",
      "why": "owner on r2 paint: spear a big cone, odd leg orientation, front cloak wrong, armour reduced to ovals. Planted symmetric stance; long thin blade; front tabard as a short ragged skirt split around the legs; layered 3-lame pauldrons; diamond knee plates. Armour detail is the painter's job from the identity reference."
    }
  ],
